      <activity id="5fa719de-e148-5a9a-9c86-053026665dd7" activityNameId="e1e6000a-6142-594e-95b5-9dfb278a6891" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roundwood, azobe (SFM), under bark, u=30%, at forest road</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roundwood, azobe (SFM), under bark, u=30%, at forest road
dataset represents well-documented, legally operating logging company with modern equipment;
Synonyms: Bongassi, Ekki, Lophira alata; 
UUID: 21bad7ea-dfe1-3fc1-835d-5e7216a46a34
includes harvesting and  hauling operations as well as fuel used for forest road construction, including burning of branchings; land use of forest roads and gravel are distregarded; branchings are left to rot on the ground. logging impacts on further vegetation and environmental impacts from post-harvest processes (potential forest degradation/deforestation) are not covered.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: modern machinery and equipment; high technological standard and legal operations cannot be assumed to be representative for azobe harvesting
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_21bad7ea-dfe1-3fc1-835d-5e7216a46a34.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
